{
  "name": "sbm-declaration-services",
  "version": "1",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "1 - Excel yukle",
      "seq": 1,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/upload",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "pentest",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "multipartForm",
          "multipartForm": [
            {
              "type": "file",
              "name": "file",
              "value": [
                "pentest-ornek-beyanname.xlsx"
              ],
              "enabled": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "pentest-ornek-beyanname.xlsx dosyasini yukler (12 satir, 6 grup, donem 2026-8).\nONEMLI: Import sonrasi Bruno'da Body > File alanindan dosyayi kendi diskinizdeki\nyoldan yeniden secin; JSON icindeki yol goreceli tutuldu.\n\nBeklenen: 200, inserted=12, failed=0, errors=[].\nAyni dosya ikinci kez yuklenirse 12 satir da ALZ-EXCEL-DUPLICATE verir."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "2 - Kayitlari listele",
      "seq": 2,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/processes?status=NEW&year=2026&month=8&page=0&size=50&sort=id,desc",
        "method": "GET",
        "headers": [],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "Yuklenen satirlari ve ID'lerini gorur. Gonderim sonrasi status=SENT,\nsorgu sonrasi status=COMPLETED ile tekrar calistirilabilir."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "3 - Gonder (POST) - il 34",
      "seq": 3,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/send",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "enabled": true
          },
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "pentest",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "json",
          "json": "{\n  \"year\": 2026,\n  \"month\": 8,\n  \"cityCode\": 34\n}"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "Ornek Excel'deki il 34 grubunu SBM'ye gonderir (1 grup = 2 satir:\nMENKUL + GAYRIMENKUL, ysvDosyaNo PENTEST260801, ilceKodu 0 oldugu icin\npayload'a konmaz).\n\nBeklenen: 200, totalGroups=1, successCount=1.\nTum dosyayi gondermek icin cityCode satirini silin (6 grup).\nDIKKAT: gercekten SBM'ye veri gonderir."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "4 - Guncelle (PUT) - il 34",
      "seq": 4,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/update",
        "method": "PUT",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "enabled": true
          },
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "pentest",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "json",
          "json": "{\n  \"year\": 2026,\n  \"month\": 8,\n  \"cityCode\": 34\n}"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "Ayni grubu SBM'de gunceller. Yalnizca SENT / COMPLETED kayitlari alir,\nyani once 3. istek basarili olmali.\nPUT govdesinde ay/yil/ilKodu/ilceKodu yoktur."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "5 - Sorgula (GET) - PENTEST260801",
      "seq": 5,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/query/PENTEST260801",
        "method": "GET",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "pentest",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "Beyannameyi SBM'den sorgular; basarili olursa ilgili satirlari COMPLETED yapar.\nYanit zarfi: { result, data, status }.\nNot: SC-UAT'ta ESB proxy'sinin GET route'u parametreleri SBM'ye tasimiyordu\n(CORE-00004) - duzeltme ESB tarafinda."
      }
    }
  ],
